{'symbol': 'AAL', 'date': '2022-01-18 16:30:00', 'title': 'AMERICAN AIRLINES NAMES GREGORY D. SMITH TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': "FORT WORTH, TEXAS, JAN. 18, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- AMERICAN AIRLINES GROUP INC. (NASDAQ: AAL) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE ELECTION OF GREGORY D. SMITH, 55, TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS. SMITH WILL SERVE ON THE BOARD'S AUDIT COMMITTEE AND CORPORATE GOVERNANCE, PUBLIC RESPONSIBILITY AND SAFETY COMMITTEE."}